1
00:00:00,917 --> 00:00:04,337
[theme music playing]

2
00:00:11,219 --> 00:00:13,388
<i>So, did you check on him</i>
<i>since he just got out of jail?</i>

3
00:00:13,471 --> 00:00:14,764
<i>Did you sleep with him?</i>

4
00:00:15,265 --> 00:00:17,100
<i>I'll do everything I can to stop him.</i>

5
00:00:17,183 --> 00:00:19,519
<i>-As long as it keeps him away from you!</i>
<i>-Arnaldo!</i>

6
00:00:20,478 --> 00:00:21,813
<i>Arnaldo!</i>

7
00:00:21,896 --> 00:00:23,231
[Julio] <i>What's happening to you?</i>

8
00:00:24,190 --> 00:00:26,192
<i>You should focus on Emilia.</i>

9
00:00:26,276 --> 00:00:29,446
<i>Use her, so that you can get</i>
<i>all of the Ardientes' wealth.</i>

10
00:00:29,529 --> 00:00:32,073
[Raul] <i>Don't worry about Emilia.</i>
<i>I'm already working on it.</i>

11
00:00:32,157 --> 00:00:34,659
<i>Pills? I don't need this. I'm not crazy!</i>

12
00:00:34,743 --> 00:00:37,328
[Julio] <i>Just take the medication.</i>

13
00:00:37,412 --> 00:00:39,748
[Ivy] <i>I'll rob you</i>
<i>of your sanity, Arnaldo.</i>

14
00:00:39,831 --> 00:00:42,792
<i>I won't leave a shred of it.</i>

15
00:00:42,876 --> 00:00:44,210
<i>I'll make you lose your mind</i>

16
00:00:44,294 --> 00:00:46,546
<i>to the point that you'll beg for death.</i>

17
00:00:46,629 --> 00:00:47,881
ARNALDO, CONFESS YOUR SINS…

18
00:00:48,423 --> 00:00:49,507
<i>Who sent this?!</i>

19
00:00:49,591 --> 00:00:53,428
<i>Don't take them off until</i>
<i>you hear Arnaldo going berserk.</i>

20
00:00:55,638 --> 00:00:58,558
<i>Are… Are you seeing this?</i>
<i>What are you doing?!</i>

21
00:00:58,641 --> 00:01:00,185
<i>Are you taking a video of me?!</i>

22
00:01:00,268 --> 00:01:01,728
[Emilia] <i>Ever since</i>
<i>you became his fiancée…</i>

23
00:01:01,811 --> 00:01:03,438
<i>-he's started acting crazy!</i>
<i>-That's enough!</i>

24
00:01:03,521 --> 00:01:04,314
<i>I'm not crazy!</i>

25
00:01:04,397 --> 00:01:06,107
<i>I'm the mayor of this town</i>
<i>and soon-to-be governor.</i>

26
00:01:06,191 --> 00:01:07,108
<i>Nothing will change.</i>

27
00:01:07,192 --> 00:01:07,942
<i>You won't attend the debate!</i>

28
00:01:08,026 --> 00:01:09,861
<i>You'll only make a fool</i>
<i>of yourself, Arnaldo!</i>

29
00:01:09,944 --> 00:01:12,822
<i>Listen to me! I am still your mother!</i>

30
00:01:12,906 --> 00:01:15,742
<i>Diego Torillo for a new Ardiente!</i>

31
00:01:15,825 --> 00:01:17,327
<i>Viva Ardiente!</i>

32
00:01:17,410 --> 00:01:20,246
[man 1] <i>Mayor Arnaldo's throwing</i>
<i>a fit outside.</i>

33
00:01:20,330 --> 00:01:24,167
<i>His huge poster got vandalized</i>
<i>with the word murderer on it.</i>

34
00:01:24,250 --> 00:01:26,336
[Julio] <i>Emilia. Emilia, answer your phone.</i>

35
00:01:26,419 --> 00:01:29,547
<i>We cannot jeopardize Arnaldo's win.</i>

36
00:01:29,631 --> 00:01:30,423
<i>Emilia--</i>

37
00:01:30,507 --> 00:01:33,134
[Jaguar] <i>I really want to dance with you.</i>

38
00:01:33,218 --> 00:01:34,636
<i>But on one condition.</i>

39
00:01:35,845 --> 00:01:37,096
[woman] <i>You may now go to the front,</i>

40
00:01:37,180 --> 00:01:39,349
Mayor Arnaldo Ardiente-Torillo.

41
00:01:39,432 --> 00:01:41,559
<i>Mr. Diego Ardiente-Torillo.</i>

42
00:01:41,643 --> 00:01:46,439
[supporters cheering]

43
00:01:51,069 --> 00:01:53,613
I want you to cancel everything.

44
00:01:53,696 --> 00:01:56,032
I'm sorry, but I can't, Congressman!

45
00:01:56,533 --> 00:02:00,078
What do you mean you can't? Huh? Hey!

46
00:02:00,829 --> 00:02:02,831
I'll pay for all your expenses,

47
00:02:02,914 --> 00:02:04,124
if that's what you're worried about.

48
00:02:04,207 --> 00:02:07,043
And please, don't test my patience!

49
00:02:07,127 --> 00:02:09,462
Because if you insist
on having it your way,

50
00:02:09,546 --> 00:02:11,923
I won't let my grandson go there!

51
00:02:12,006 --> 00:02:15,635
You will never see
Arnaldo Ardiente-Torillo!

52
00:02:16,302 --> 00:02:18,346
-Congressman--
-Shut up!

53
00:02:19,222 --> 00:02:20,807
Can't you understand--

54
00:02:20,890 --> 00:02:23,852
You know, you should be thankful
I'm not feeling well,

55
00:02:23,935 --> 00:02:25,854
or else I would be there.

56
00:02:25,937 --> 00:02:29,107
And if I were there, you'd be
kneeling in front of me!

57
00:02:29,524 --> 00:02:30,859
<i>Remember this…</i>

58
00:02:31,568 --> 00:02:37,282
When Julio Ardiente tells you
to do something, you do it!

59
00:02:37,907 --> 00:02:38,992
Yes, Congressman.

60
00:02:44,831 --> 00:02:48,668
-Diego Torillo! Diego Torillo!
-Arnaldo! Arnaldo! Arnaldo!

61
00:02:48,751 --> 00:02:51,421
Kate, please tell Mayor
the debate is canceled.

62
00:02:51,504 --> 00:02:53,756
Okay? Go to him now.

63
00:02:57,343 --> 00:02:59,220
Diego Torillo!

64
00:03:00,013 --> 00:03:01,139
[no audible dialogue]

65
00:03:03,892 --> 00:03:05,643
Mayor, the debate's been canceled.

66
00:03:10,523 --> 00:03:11,482
[clears throat]

67
00:03:15,862 --> 00:03:17,322
Hon, why? What happened?

68
00:03:17,405 --> 00:03:20,450
[Arnaldo] I… I don't know.
What's happening?

69
00:03:20,533 --> 00:03:24,329
Mayor, we are sorry.
We have to cancel the debate.

70
00:03:24,412 --> 00:03:28,249
This is unprofessional. He's ready.

71
00:03:28,333 --> 00:03:31,419
We apologize.
It's the congressman's orders.

72
00:03:34,422 --> 00:03:37,133
Grandpa canceled it. He doesn't trust me.

73
00:03:37,217 --> 00:03:38,635
He doesn't have faith in me.

74
00:03:38,718 --> 00:03:39,594
I know, hon.

75
00:03:39,677 --> 00:03:42,764
I'm shocked to learn your grandfather…

76
00:03:42,847 --> 00:03:44,682
-feels that way.
-He doesn't have faith in me.

77
00:03:44,766 --> 00:03:45,934
But, hon…

78
00:03:46,017 --> 00:03:48,561
Arnaldo, you need to go through with this.

79
00:03:48,645 --> 00:03:50,730
If I were you, I'd push through
with the debate.

80
00:03:51,522 --> 00:03:53,066
Because I trust you.

81
00:03:53,608 --> 00:03:55,151
You need to go through with it.

82
00:03:55,902 --> 00:04:01,241
It's not your grandfather
who'll embarrass himself

83
00:04:01,324 --> 00:04:04,244
if you won't go through
with this, you will.

84
00:04:04,869 --> 00:04:07,664
So, if I were you, Arnaldo, I'd do it.

85
00:04:08,206 --> 00:04:09,958
I… I… I understand.

86
00:04:10,041 --> 00:04:13,628
But there must be a reason
why he wanted it canceled,

87
00:04:13,711 --> 00:04:16,547
so let's find out. Let's find out.

88
00:04:16,631 --> 00:04:18,466
-Let's find out.
-Hon, go through with it.

89
00:04:18,925 --> 00:04:20,260
Don't you want to?

90
00:04:20,343 --> 00:04:25,014
No. There must be a reason…
Let's find out. Let's find out.

91
00:04:25,848 --> 00:04:29,060
-Let's… let's find out.
-So, you're canceling it?

92
00:04:29,143 --> 00:04:30,478
Let's find out.

93
00:04:30,561 --> 00:04:31,396
-Okay.
-Let's find out.

94
00:04:31,479 --> 00:04:32,230
Let's find out.

95
00:04:32,313 --> 00:04:33,856
-Let's find out--
-Mamita.

96
00:04:33,940 --> 00:04:36,109
-Let's find out.
-Let's go.

97
00:04:36,192 --> 00:04:40,613
Let's find out.
Let's find out. Let's find out.

98
00:04:42,323 --> 00:04:43,324
[woman] What happened?

99
00:04:44,325 --> 00:04:47,120
[tense music playing]

100
00:04:48,538 --> 00:04:49,831
[Kate] We are very sorry to announce

101
00:04:49,914 --> 00:04:52,333
that the debate will not push through.

102
00:04:53,543 --> 00:04:57,338
[crowd murmuring]

103
00:04:57,422 --> 00:05:03,177
[supporters clamoring]

104
00:05:04,345 --> 00:05:08,141
[unintelligible]

105
00:05:08,683 --> 00:05:10,685
[clamoring]

106
00:05:10,768 --> 00:05:12,145
Miss, excuse me.

107
00:05:12,228 --> 00:05:14,647
We're ready for the debate. What happened?

108
00:05:14,731 --> 00:05:16,524
Sorry, ma'am. There was an emergency.

109
00:05:16,607 --> 00:05:19,527
The congressman had the debate canceled.

110
00:05:20,611 --> 00:05:21,612
Okay, thank you.

111
00:05:23,573 --> 00:05:24,657
Everyone!

112
00:05:25,533 --> 00:05:28,828
Julio Ardiente had the debate canceled.

113
00:05:29,412 --> 00:05:32,040
I'm sure they want
to protect Arnaldo's image

114
00:05:32,123 --> 00:05:35,460
because Diego will reveal
all of their darkest secrets.

115
00:05:35,543 --> 00:05:36,461
-That's right!
-That's right! Yeah!

116
00:05:36,544 --> 00:05:41,132
[Loring] Typical! Just when we were ready!

117
00:05:41,841 --> 00:05:43,009
[Diego] Friends!

118
00:05:44,218 --> 00:05:47,680
If they can be silenced by the Ardientes,

119
00:05:47,764 --> 00:05:48,931
we'll stand our ground.

120
00:05:49,640 --> 00:05:51,142
We shouldn't be afraid.

121
00:05:51,225 --> 00:05:55,354
We should fight back
and unite for justice!

122
00:05:55,438 --> 00:05:56,522
[man] Down with the Ardientes!

123
00:05:56,606 --> 00:05:58,316
[crowd] Take them down! Take them down!

124
00:05:58,399 --> 00:06:03,821
Bring down the Ardientes! Take them down!

125
00:06:03,905 --> 00:06:07,283
Take them down! Bring down the Ardientes!

126
00:06:07,366 --> 00:06:09,619
Bring down the Ardientes! Take them down!

127
00:06:10,286 --> 00:06:12,330
[instrumental music playing]

128
00:06:21,839 --> 00:06:25,718
[distorted voice] Emilia.
I can't wait for you to be mine.

129
00:06:29,514 --> 00:06:31,265
[Emilia exhales and groans]

130
00:06:33,851 --> 00:06:34,852
Enough!

131
00:06:36,604 --> 00:06:40,608
You know, I appreciate that
I feel so loved and valued now.

132
00:06:40,691 --> 00:06:42,276
But this is not enough.

133
00:06:43,402 --> 00:06:46,739
Why don't we join forces, then?
Come with me, Emilia.

134
00:06:47,240 --> 00:06:52,161
Jaguar. The offer you made me
isn't enough to convince me

135
00:06:52,245 --> 00:06:54,455
to join forces with you
and abandon my father.

136
00:06:56,958 --> 00:07:00,002
[tense music playing]

137
00:07:00,711 --> 00:07:05,633
And by the way, next time…
it's your turn to be tied up.

138
00:07:23,234 --> 00:07:26,362
Arnaldo forcefully sent me
to prison without a trial.

139
00:07:27,405 --> 00:07:29,740
But now I'm free.

140
00:07:30,741 --> 00:07:32,368
I won't back down.

141
00:07:32,452 --> 00:07:36,998
The Ardientes will do everything
just to get what they want!

142
00:07:38,499 --> 00:07:40,042
They'll push us into a corner!

143
00:07:40,126 --> 00:07:41,043
They'll threaten.

144
00:07:41,127 --> 00:07:43,671
But we shouldn't let them scare us.

145
00:07:43,754 --> 00:07:48,176
We won't stop
until the truth is in our hands!

146
00:07:48,259 --> 00:07:49,218
-That's right.
-Correct.

147
00:07:49,302 --> 00:07:50,136
That's right, Miss Camia.

148
00:07:50,219 --> 00:07:52,930
It's time for us to fight.

149
00:07:53,014 --> 00:07:57,727
Let's put an end
to the tyranny of the Ardientes!

150
00:07:57,810 --> 00:07:59,520
-That's right!
-[applause]

151
00:07:59,604 --> 00:08:03,566
Diego! Diego! For real change!

152
00:08:03,649 --> 00:08:07,236
Diego Torillo for real change!

153
00:08:07,320 --> 00:08:14,285
Diego Torillo for real change!
Diego Torillo for real change!

154
00:08:14,368 --> 00:08:17,955
Diego Torillo for real change!

155
00:08:18,039 --> 00:08:21,501
Diego Torillo for real change!

156
00:08:23,002 --> 00:08:24,670
[ominous music playing]

157
00:08:27,465 --> 00:08:30,510
I KNOW THE TRUTH ABOUT IVY AGUAS.

158
00:08:36,516 --> 00:08:39,810
[phone ringing]

159
00:08:41,687 --> 00:08:42,688
Hello?

160
00:08:43,606 --> 00:08:47,902
Now then, tell me
everything there is to know

161
00:08:47,985 --> 00:08:51,447
about the woman we know as Ivy Aguas.

162
00:08:58,663 --> 00:09:03,626
[suspenseful music playing]

163
00:09:10,591 --> 00:09:11,592
Aguas.

164
00:09:11,676 --> 00:09:13,302
-Have a seat, ma'am.
-Thank you.

165
00:09:18,140 --> 00:09:19,183
Thank you.

166
00:09:25,356 --> 00:09:26,357
[phone ringing]

167
00:09:28,859 --> 00:09:29,944
[phone ringing]

168
00:09:32,863 --> 00:09:34,031
Yes, Emilia?

169
00:09:34,740 --> 00:09:37,368
-Ivy!
-Can I help you?

170
00:09:37,451 --> 00:09:41,455
Where are you? Can we meet?

171
00:09:43,207 --> 00:09:44,542
I'll come see you, okay?

172
00:09:45,001 --> 00:09:46,836
[suspenseful music playing]

173
00:09:48,879 --> 00:09:49,755
Bye!

174
00:09:55,636 --> 00:10:01,934
Ivy, Ivy Aguas… Too many secrets!

175
00:10:10,610 --> 00:10:12,445
-They're in trouble now.
-We'll show them all.

176
00:10:12,528 --> 00:10:14,322
We'll get our revenge.

177
00:10:14,405 --> 00:10:16,824
-[laughter]
-[indistinct chatter]

178
00:10:16,907 --> 00:10:19,452
Mr. Diego, this is our chance.

179
00:10:19,535 --> 00:10:20,745
[Diego's supporter] Yes.

180
00:10:26,751 --> 00:10:29,211
[laughs] Do the honors, Mr. Diego.

181
00:10:33,090 --> 00:10:34,800
JULIO THE HEADHUNTER
EMILIA THE LIAR

182
00:10:34,884 --> 00:10:35,885
ARNALDO THE CLOWN

183
00:11:03,329 --> 00:11:05,831
[screams]

184
00:11:07,124 --> 00:11:09,126
Insolent bastards!

185
00:11:27,520 --> 00:11:31,982
-For a new Ardiente!
-For a new Ardiente!

186
00:11:32,066 --> 00:11:35,528
-What are you doing?!
-What's happening?

187
00:11:35,611 --> 00:11:37,321
-What are you doing?!
-What are you doing?!

188
00:11:37,405 --> 00:11:40,074
What are you doing?! Stop that!

189
00:11:40,157 --> 00:11:42,451
-What are you doing?!
-What are you doing?!

190
00:11:42,535 --> 00:11:43,452
Diego Torillo for the new Ardiente!

191
00:11:43,536 --> 00:11:46,580
Oust the Ardientes!

192
00:11:46,664 --> 00:11:49,834
Oust the Ardientes!

193
00:11:49,917 --> 00:11:53,129
Diego Torillo for a new Ardiente!

194
00:11:53,212 --> 00:11:54,130
[Ardiente's supporter crying]

195
00:11:54,213 --> 00:11:58,342
-How could you!?
-How dare you do this!

196
00:11:58,426 --> 00:11:59,927
…for a new Ardiente!

197
00:12:00,010 --> 00:12:01,554
Diego Torillo!

198
00:12:01,637 --> 00:12:04,682
Diego Torillo for a new Ardiente!

199
00:12:04,765 --> 00:12:08,018
Diego Torillo for a new Ardiente!

200
00:12:08,102 --> 00:12:10,938
Diego Torillo for a new Ardiente!

201
00:12:11,021 --> 00:12:15,401
-[Ardiente's supporter wailing]
-Let's go!

202
00:12:15,484 --> 00:12:20,823
[Ardiente's supporter wailing]
Why did you do that?!

203
00:12:20,906 --> 00:12:26,120
[tense music playing]

204
00:12:32,334 --> 00:12:33,210
[screams]

205
00:12:39,508 --> 00:12:42,011
Hello, where the hell is Arnaldo?

206
00:12:43,137 --> 00:12:44,763
Tell him to come see me!

207
00:12:45,931 --> 00:12:50,060
As for the other,
make that bastard suffer!

208
00:12:50,144 --> 00:12:53,898
I want Diego Torillo's head!

209
00:13:00,988 --> 00:13:03,199
Hi, Emilia! Please sit down.

210
00:13:04,700 --> 00:13:05,576
No need.

211
00:13:07,203 --> 00:13:10,998
I am so surprised
you are not with my beloved son.

212
00:13:11,665 --> 00:13:12,458
It's too bad…

213
00:13:12,541 --> 00:13:16,337
I wanted him to hear
everything I found about you…

214
00:13:16,420 --> 00:13:17,880
Ivy Aguas.

215
00:13:17,963 --> 00:13:20,549
But it doesn't matter. This can't wait.

216
00:13:22,718 --> 00:13:23,719
[sighs]

217
00:13:24,220 --> 00:13:26,347
So, you've come up with another issue.

218
00:13:26,430 --> 00:13:30,017
And here I was hoping
for a nice quiet night.

219
00:13:30,100 --> 00:13:33,979
But then, since you're here,
I doubt that's going to happen.

220
00:13:34,730 --> 00:13:36,732
Okay, no more mind games, then.

221
00:13:37,900 --> 00:13:41,654
I know the truth about your identity.

222
00:13:41,737 --> 00:13:45,824
I know all your secrets, Ivy Aguas!

223
00:13:45,908 --> 00:13:46,825
Oh.

224
00:13:46,909 --> 00:13:50,287
Emilia, haven't you dispatched
your private investigator yet?

225
00:13:50,371 --> 00:13:51,664
Stop it already.

226
00:13:51,747 --> 00:13:54,833
You're just making things worse
with what you're doing.

227
00:13:54,917 --> 00:13:56,710
Please stop it.

228
00:13:57,002 --> 00:14:01,799
My men have your adoption
papers signed by Prianka Aguas!

229
00:14:01,882 --> 00:14:04,593
She just picked you off from the streets!

230
00:14:04,677 --> 00:14:07,638
Am I right? Or am I just too right?!

231
00:14:09,306 --> 00:14:13,227
Who are you, really?
Who are you, Ivy Aguas?!

232
00:14:13,310 --> 00:14:16,230
Since you came to this province,
you ruined everything!

233
00:14:16,313 --> 00:14:20,025
You misled my family
and everyone in this town!

234
00:14:20,109 --> 00:14:21,110
Now tell me…

235
00:14:22,111 --> 00:14:23,529
Who are you, really?

236
00:14:24,530 --> 00:14:27,449
Are you Lily Cruz?!

237
00:14:27,867 --> 00:14:29,368
[dramatic music]

238
00:14:30,077 --> 00:14:33,539
[tense music swelling]

239
00:14:41,213 --> 00:14:44,675
I've got a gut feeling
that you're Lily Cruz!

240
00:14:44,758 --> 00:14:46,844
Just admit that you're Lily Cruz!

241
00:14:51,891 --> 00:14:53,642
Are you Lily Cruz?!

242
00:14:58,063 --> 00:14:59,398
[woman] No she isn't!

243
00:14:59,481 --> 00:15:02,860
[pensive music playing]

244
00:15:33,933 --> 00:15:37,895
This is the end of your search
for Lily Cruz, Emilia Ardiente!

245
00:15:37,978 --> 00:15:40,397
[tense music playing]

246
00:15:42,066 --> 00:15:43,192
And who are you?

247
00:15:44,234 --> 00:15:45,903
I'm right in front of you!

248
00:15:47,947 --> 00:15:49,198
I am Lily Cruz!

249
00:15:50,324 --> 00:15:52,785
The one and only Lily Cruz!

250
00:15:52,868 --> 00:15:55,120
Is this a joke?! [laughs]

251
00:15:55,204 --> 00:15:57,498
You're Lily Cruz? But she's Lily Cruz!

252
00:16:02,211 --> 00:16:03,337
You might be tough.

253
00:16:04,213 --> 00:16:06,757
Rich and brutal.

254
00:16:07,841 --> 00:16:11,220
But you're so easy to fool,
Emilia Ardiente.

255
00:16:12,137 --> 00:16:14,848
You're wasting your time throwing tantrums

256
00:16:14,932 --> 00:16:19,061
when you should be paying
for your crimes against me!

257
00:16:21,355 --> 00:16:24,650
Because I am Lily Cruz!

258
00:16:26,193 --> 00:16:29,113
[tense music playing]

259
00:16:29,738 --> 00:16:31,407
-You're a liar!
-Emilia!

260
00:16:32,116 --> 00:16:33,033
Emilia!

261
00:16:36,495 --> 00:16:39,456
You work for Lily Cruz! Huh?

262
00:16:39,540 --> 00:16:40,833
Don't touch me!

263
00:16:43,627 --> 00:16:44,503
You're right.

264
00:16:47,131 --> 00:16:50,134
So, don't think of harming us, Emilia.

265
00:16:50,551 --> 00:16:52,136
Because this whole place?

266
00:16:53,429 --> 00:16:55,597
It's surrounded by our men!

267
00:16:57,307 --> 00:16:58,851
Well, Emilia Ardiente…

268
00:17:00,102 --> 00:17:01,895
You look like you've seen a ghost!

269
00:17:03,439 --> 00:17:06,191
Now that the person you've been
looking for is in front of you.

270
00:17:07,860 --> 00:17:09,194
Are you scared?

271
00:17:10,487 --> 00:17:13,407
No. No!

272
00:17:13,741 --> 00:17:15,826
You poisoned my father.

273
00:17:16,827 --> 00:17:20,122
You had my mother raped,
and you wanted me dead!

274
00:17:21,206 --> 00:17:25,002
But too bad for you
I'm not a ghost, Emilia.

275
00:17:26,628 --> 00:17:29,923
Because I'm alive! Very much alive!

276
00:17:33,427 --> 00:17:34,428
[Emilia] No.

277
00:17:36,096 --> 00:17:40,100
You're a liar! You're lying! Liar!

278
00:17:41,769 --> 00:17:43,771
Are you scared? Are you trembling?

279
00:17:44,772 --> 00:17:46,815
Haven't you been looking for me?

280
00:17:46,899 --> 00:17:51,612
Now that I'm here, I will bury you alive!

281
00:17:51,695 --> 00:17:54,907
[tense music playing]

282
00:18:05,334 --> 00:18:06,627
And she's back!

283
00:18:08,128 --> 00:18:09,880
Lily Cruz really is alive.

284
00:18:22,643 --> 00:18:23,894
Emilia…

285
00:18:25,354 --> 00:18:27,356
Emilia, please don't pass out.

286
00:18:32,194 --> 00:18:35,447
[tense music continues]

287
00:18:42,746 --> 00:18:46,542
[Julio] You need to break up
with Ivy Aguas.

288
00:18:47,376 --> 00:18:48,377
Or else…

289
00:18:50,129 --> 00:18:52,798
you will lose this election.

290
00:18:53,841 --> 00:18:56,009
Grandpa, didn't we talk
about this already?

291
00:18:56,343 --> 00:18:58,137
Think hard about it.

292
00:18:59,304 --> 00:19:00,806
Think very hard.

293
00:19:00,889 --> 00:19:05,435
You killed because of Ivy Aguas.

294
00:19:05,894 --> 00:19:09,815
You framed Diego because of Ivy Aguas.

295
00:19:11,817 --> 00:19:14,111
You forget that I'm an Ardiente!

296
00:19:14,194 --> 00:19:16,864
I may love Ivy,
but I never forget who I am.

297
00:19:17,531 --> 00:19:18,574
I'm a predator.

298
00:19:18,657 --> 00:19:20,325
A predator?

299
00:19:21,326 --> 00:19:24,538
Or a kitten pretending to be a lion?

300
00:19:28,125 --> 00:19:30,085
Is that what you think of me now?

301
00:19:30,169 --> 00:19:31,253
That's why you halted the debate?

302
00:19:31,336 --> 00:19:32,421
The election hasn't begun

303
00:19:32,504 --> 00:19:34,131
and you're already
putting a nail in my coffin.

304
00:19:34,214 --> 00:19:35,799
How could you? You know what?

305
00:19:35,883 --> 00:19:37,342
All my life…

306
00:19:37,426 --> 00:19:39,928
All my life, I've been following
your orders, Grandpa.

307
00:19:40,012 --> 00:19:44,808
Now, I disobey you one time,
just one time, for my happiness.

308
00:19:44,892 --> 00:19:47,436
For Ivy. And now you think I'm trash?

309
00:19:47,519 --> 00:19:48,562
Well, I'm not surprised.

310
00:19:48,645 --> 00:19:50,647
You only love me because
I've been obedient to you.

311
00:19:50,731 --> 00:19:54,234
You only love me because
I'm the one you can control.

312
00:19:54,318 --> 00:19:55,444
I'm the only one you can control.

313
00:19:55,527 --> 00:19:56,737
I'm the only one you can control…

314
00:19:56,820 --> 00:20:00,949
I'm the only one you
can control… Stop. Stop.

315
00:20:01,033 --> 00:20:04,036
My beloved grandson…

316
00:20:05,037 --> 00:20:10,959
Believe it or not, I have never
loved anybody in my life…

317
00:20:12,502 --> 00:20:14,213
more than I have loved you.

318
00:20:37,402 --> 00:20:41,198
Jepoy, what is Anna doing here
in Poblacion Ardiente?

319
00:20:46,119 --> 00:20:47,996
I missed you so much, Lily.

320
00:21:02,928 --> 00:21:06,181
<i>You love me because I'm</i>
<i>the only one you can control.</i>

321
00:21:09,309 --> 00:21:13,188
I will control you if I have to, Arnaldo.

322
00:21:17,609 --> 00:21:23,365
Because you are the sole heir
to the power of the Ardientes.

323
00:21:26,118 --> 00:21:32,749
An Ardiente should be the only
one to rule Poblacion Ardiente.

324
00:21:35,335 --> 00:21:40,632
And your failure is not an option.

325
00:21:47,556 --> 00:21:49,474
I thought we wouldn't make it.

326
00:21:52,686 --> 00:21:55,105
Thank you for that. But, Anna…

327
00:21:57,065 --> 00:21:59,151
What's happening, Jepoy?

328
00:21:59,234 --> 00:22:01,695
Why do you have to pretend to be me?

329
00:22:01,778 --> 00:22:03,613
To help you, Lily.

330
00:22:08,535 --> 00:22:10,037
I'm not Lily anymore.

331
00:22:10,120 --> 00:22:11,538
It's Ivy Aguas now.

332
00:22:12,122 --> 00:22:14,499
You should call me Ivy.

333
00:22:15,417 --> 00:22:17,878
I'm sorry. I just got used to…

334
00:22:19,755 --> 00:22:22,424
I know everything. Jepoy told me--

335
00:22:22,507 --> 00:22:24,551
Of course Jepoy told you everything.

336
00:22:26,136 --> 00:22:27,637
Seriously, Jepoy?

337
00:22:28,638 --> 00:22:30,724
We've talked about this, remember?

338
00:22:30,807 --> 00:22:33,393
No one else can know about my secret

339
00:22:33,477 --> 00:22:35,020
because I wanted to keep it between us.

340
00:22:35,103 --> 00:22:36,396
No one else will get involved.

341
00:22:36,480 --> 00:22:38,315
And now you told Anna?

342
00:22:38,398 --> 00:22:40,901
Ivy, believe me. I tried my best to--

343
00:22:40,984 --> 00:22:43,278
It was my decision to help you, Ivy.

344
00:22:44,196 --> 00:22:45,822
Didn't we make a promise?

345
00:22:45,906 --> 00:22:49,493
That, whatever happens,
we won't abandon one another?

346
00:22:51,203 --> 00:22:53,038
<i>-One for all.</i>
<i>-All for one.</i>

347
00:22:53,121 --> 00:22:54,164
<i>Together forever.</i>

348
00:22:54,247 --> 00:22:55,457
<i>-One for all.</i>
<i>-All for one.</i>

349
00:22:55,540 --> 00:22:57,667
-<i>Together…</i>
-[all] <i>forever!</i>

350
00:22:57,751 --> 00:22:59,002
<i>Yay!</i>

351
00:23:06,927 --> 00:23:09,429
I haven't forgotten that promise.

352
00:23:10,764 --> 00:23:12,140
But, Anna…

353
00:23:13,141 --> 00:23:16,770
Anna, it's so dangerous… for you.

354
00:23:16,853 --> 00:23:20,315
But we got Emilia Ardiente
to believe I'm Lily Cruz, right?

355
00:23:23,318 --> 00:23:24,611
Anna, believe me.

356
00:23:24,694 --> 00:23:26,905
There's no way to make sure

357
00:23:26,988 --> 00:23:30,283
that monster believes
you really are Lily Cruz.

358
00:23:30,992 --> 00:23:34,371
Anna, I won't allow you to get hurt.

359
00:23:34,454 --> 00:23:36,414
I don't know what I would do if…

360
00:23:37,707 --> 00:23:39,459
if the Ardientes hurt you too.

361
00:23:39,543 --> 00:23:40,919
So, please…

362
00:23:41,002 --> 00:23:42,754
Jepoy, take Anna away from here.

363
00:23:42,838 --> 00:23:45,132
Take her back home.

364
00:23:45,215 --> 00:23:46,216
Lily…

365
00:23:47,717 --> 00:23:48,718
Ivy.

366
00:23:49,219 --> 00:23:50,929
I won't abandon you.

367
00:23:56,226 --> 00:23:57,644
Anna, thank you.

368
00:23:58,728 --> 00:24:01,523
But you have no business
being in Poblacion Ardiente.

369
00:24:02,315 --> 00:24:03,400
Listen to me.

370
00:24:03,483 --> 00:24:05,068
Ivy, I know everything.

371
00:24:06,069 --> 00:24:08,238
Those Ardientes ruined your life.

372
00:24:08,321 --> 00:24:10,740
But you're not the only one
who lost a loved one.

373
00:24:10,824 --> 00:24:12,325
Aunt Carlotta was like a mother to me too.

374
00:24:12,409 --> 00:24:16,246
Please don't deny me the chance
to seek justice for her death.

375
00:24:16,329 --> 00:24:19,916
[suspenseful music playing]

376
00:24:32,888 --> 00:24:33,847
[grunts]

377
00:24:36,308 --> 00:24:37,934
<i>I'm Lily Cruz!</i>

378
00:24:38,018 --> 00:24:40,187
<i>Now that I'm here,</i>

379
00:24:40,270 --> 00:24:42,814
[echoing] <i>I will bury you alive!</i>

380
00:24:45,066 --> 00:24:47,527
Lily Cruz. Lily Cruz.

381
00:24:47,611 --> 00:24:49,362
This is not happening. Come on.

382
00:24:49,446 --> 00:24:52,407
Emilia, think. Think. Lily Cruz.

383
00:24:52,490 --> 00:24:53,533
[dishes clatter]

384
00:24:53,617 --> 00:24:55,869
Ouch!

385
00:24:55,952 --> 00:24:56,995
[exclaims]

386
00:24:57,871 --> 00:24:59,956
Get out of my sight!

387
00:25:00,040 --> 00:25:01,124
You're such an idiot!

388
00:25:02,417 --> 00:25:03,418
[screams]

389
00:25:03,960 --> 00:25:05,629
-[exhales sharply]
-[Julio] Emilia!

390
00:25:06,254 --> 00:25:10,842
Why are you screaming like a cat in heat?

391
00:25:10,926 --> 00:25:13,637
What's wrong with you? Well?

392
00:25:17,224 --> 00:25:18,225
What!?

393
00:25:19,226 --> 00:25:20,727
-Papa…
-What?

394
00:25:22,520 --> 00:25:25,607
-Lily Cruz is back.
-What?

395
00:25:27,400 --> 00:25:28,902
You heard me, Papa.

396
00:25:28,985 --> 00:25:31,529
I said Lily Cruz is back.

397
00:25:31,613 --> 00:25:32,948
In the flesh.

398
00:25:33,031 --> 00:25:35,242
[suspenseful music swelling]

399
00:25:35,325 --> 00:25:36,326
Emilia.

400
00:25:37,118 --> 00:25:41,623
If this is one of
your episodes of paranoia,

401
00:25:41,706 --> 00:25:44,793
then just sit down
and pass out on the couch…

402
00:25:44,876 --> 00:25:46,461
because no one here
is willing to catch you.

403
00:25:46,544 --> 00:25:47,921
No, Papa.

404
00:25:48,004 --> 00:25:50,924
I'm not paranoid and, this time,
I'm telling the truth.

405
00:25:51,007 --> 00:25:53,343
I saw her with my two eyes, Papa.

406
00:25:53,426 --> 00:25:56,054
I saw her! She's alive.

407
00:25:56,137 --> 00:25:58,556
She's back. And guess who?

408
00:25:58,640 --> 00:26:01,601
With whom, Papa?! Madrigal!

409
00:26:03,979 --> 00:26:07,065
So, that guy's been playing us all along.

410
00:26:07,148 --> 00:26:10,860
[ominous music playing]

411
00:26:12,904 --> 00:26:14,864
This isn't just your fight, Ivy.

412
00:26:15,740 --> 00:26:19,077
I lost a foster mother
because of Arnaldo Ardiente.

413
00:26:26,126 --> 00:26:29,212
I owe so much to Aunt Carlotta, Ivy.

414
00:26:29,296 --> 00:26:32,549
She raised me when my parents died.

415
00:26:32,632 --> 00:26:35,885
That's why I have to make
Arnaldo Ardiente pay.

416
00:26:36,636 --> 00:26:37,679
You can't.

417
00:26:41,016 --> 00:26:42,475
Anna, you will go back home.

418
00:26:43,852 --> 00:26:48,523
You have no idea just what
the Ardientes are capable of.

419
00:26:48,606 --> 00:26:50,525
-Ivy. I don't care.
-You can't!

420
00:26:51,109 --> 00:26:53,570
I'll do this whether you like it or not,

421
00:26:53,653 --> 00:26:54,946
with or without your permission.

422
00:26:55,030 --> 00:26:58,450
I won't let them do to you
what they did to Nanny Carlotta.

423
00:26:59,409 --> 00:27:01,619
You're leaving, Anna.

424
00:27:05,498 --> 00:27:09,461
You will listen to me
whether you like it or not.

425
00:27:19,012 --> 00:27:23,433
It's for your own good, Anna.
It's for your own good.

426
00:27:30,857 --> 00:27:32,233
Are you sure?

427
00:27:32,984 --> 00:27:34,569
So, you mean to tell me…

428
00:27:35,362 --> 00:27:39,449
that while that rat Madrigal was away,

429
00:27:39,532 --> 00:27:43,411
they were actually preparing
for Lily Cruz's comeback?

430
00:27:44,412 --> 00:27:46,331
Yes, Papa. Yes.

431
00:27:46,831 --> 00:27:50,335
That stinking bloodsucking leech!

432
00:27:50,418 --> 00:27:52,253
Yes, Papa. And guess what?

433
00:27:52,337 --> 00:27:55,632
I found out from my private investigator…

434
00:27:56,424 --> 00:27:58,510
that Ivy Aguas was adopted.

435
00:27:58,593 --> 00:28:00,178
So, there are two things now.

436
00:28:00,261 --> 00:28:02,680
Number one, she's a liar.

437
00:28:02,764 --> 00:28:05,558
Number two, she must be the real Lily Cruz

438
00:28:05,642 --> 00:28:07,310
because she's been
hiding her real identity!

439
00:28:07,394 --> 00:28:09,729
When will you leave Ivy alone?

440
00:28:10,897 --> 00:28:13,233
The real Lily Cruz
already revealed herself,

441
00:28:13,316 --> 00:28:15,026
but you still won't leave Ivy alone?!

442
00:28:16,528 --> 00:28:17,904
That's what our family is good at.

443
00:28:17,987 --> 00:28:20,323
We're experts at sabotaging our own.

444
00:28:21,241 --> 00:28:22,242
No, Arnaldo.

445
00:28:23,118 --> 00:28:27,288
I will never let her become an Ardiente.

446
00:28:27,372 --> 00:28:31,918
Because she has so many secrets,
and, until I uncover them all,

447
00:28:32,001 --> 00:28:33,920
I won't leave your whore alone!

448
00:28:34,003 --> 00:28:35,171
[exclaims]

449
00:28:35,255 --> 00:28:37,173
I would like to see you try!
So, you'll feel this knife…

450
00:28:37,257 --> 00:28:38,049
-Papa!
-Arnaldo!

451
00:28:38,133 --> 00:28:39,759
…run through your chest.

452
00:28:39,843 --> 00:28:41,428
And I'll see you in hell.

453
00:28:41,511 --> 00:28:42,846
Because I'll follow you.

454
00:28:42,929 --> 00:28:45,682
It's only a matter of time
before this old man joins us.

455
00:28:45,765 --> 00:28:48,101
See! One big, happy family in hell!

456
00:28:48,184 --> 00:28:49,728
-Arnaldo!
-I say let's start now!

457
00:28:49,811 --> 00:28:51,271
[Emilia exclaims] Papa!

458
00:28:52,814 --> 00:28:54,524
[Julio] Put that blade down!

459
00:28:56,317 --> 00:28:59,404
Look at me! Look at me!

460
00:29:01,322 --> 00:29:05,034
This old man, whom you refer to…

461
00:29:06,411 --> 00:29:08,538
is the man who made you!

462
00:29:09,622 --> 00:29:11,666
I am the man who created you!

463
00:29:11,750 --> 00:29:15,044
I am the man who gave you brains!

464
00:29:15,128 --> 00:29:17,547
I am the man who put you in power!

465
00:29:17,630 --> 00:29:22,093
So, get rid of this knife, and don't ever…

466
00:29:23,511 --> 00:29:29,434
ever try to scare me
with your little antics.

467
00:29:31,728 --> 00:29:33,605
Look at us! Huh?

468
00:29:34,272 --> 00:29:36,608
Is this what you want?! This?!

469
00:29:37,859 --> 00:29:41,321
You want us to murder each other
all because of a small problem?!

470
00:29:44,240 --> 00:29:49,204
The enemy is using
elementary tactics on us!

471
00:29:51,039 --> 00:29:52,749
The art of war!

472
00:29:53,416 --> 00:29:55,877
Divide and conquer!

473
00:29:56,544 --> 00:29:58,046
Keep this in mind.

474
00:29:58,129 --> 00:30:00,256
Even if there's a problem…

475
00:30:00,340 --> 00:30:03,343
even if we have issues with each other,

476
00:30:04,427 --> 00:30:07,722
we never turn on family!

477
00:30:09,349 --> 00:30:14,312
Blood is thicker and should always be

478
00:30:15,146 --> 00:30:16,773
thicker than water.

479
00:30:19,442 --> 00:30:23,238
We have this province in our hands…

480
00:30:23,321 --> 00:30:25,406
And it should stay that way.

481
00:30:26,074 --> 00:30:28,159
We own Ardiente!

482
00:30:29,285 --> 00:30:32,121
And we should stick together!

483
00:30:32,914 --> 00:30:37,418
No one… No one
takes the power away from us!

484
00:30:39,254 --> 00:30:41,548
You put that in your thick heads.

485
00:30:58,815 --> 00:31:00,650
[Camia] Please, come in!

486
00:31:00,733 --> 00:31:02,443
-Nice house, Ma'am Camia.
-Are you all hungry?

487
00:31:02,527 --> 00:31:04,070
Famished. Oh, wait, let me help you.

488
00:31:04,153 --> 00:31:05,572
I'm going to help too!

489
00:31:05,655 --> 00:31:06,739
I'm clueless, but I'll help too!

490
00:31:06,823 --> 00:31:08,324
-Where's the kitchen?
-Make yourselves at home!

491
00:31:08,408 --> 00:31:10,076
-Yeah, where's the kitchen?
-I might just lie down here…

492
00:31:10,159 --> 00:31:11,160
-to feel at home.
-[chuckles]

493
00:31:11,244 --> 00:31:12,328
Oh, Mr. Pandoy!

494
00:31:20,920 --> 00:31:22,839
<i>You're going down, Arnaldo.</i>

495
00:31:24,007 --> 00:31:26,759
<i>Your reign over this town</i>
<i>will soon be over.</i>

496
00:31:28,428 --> 00:31:29,888
<i>Soon…</i>

497
00:31:31,222 --> 00:31:36,519
<i>this province will be freed</i>
<i>from your family's deadly grip.</i>

498
00:31:41,316 --> 00:31:43,860
This is all your fault, Papa!

499
00:31:45,236 --> 00:31:46,362
See?

500
00:31:46,446 --> 00:31:49,115
You just created a monster in Arnaldo!

501
00:31:49,824 --> 00:31:51,117
He almost killed me!

502
00:31:51,200 --> 00:31:53,036
His own mother!

503
00:31:53,119 --> 00:31:55,622
Papa… And that's unforgivable!

504
00:31:56,331 --> 00:31:57,957
I'm sorry to say this, Papa,

505
00:31:58,041 --> 00:31:59,834
but Diego will win this election!

506
00:31:59,918 --> 00:32:01,669
Is that what you think?!

507
00:32:02,211 --> 00:32:03,588
Is that what you believe?

508
00:32:04,297 --> 00:32:09,344
If so, we start moving heaven and earth

509
00:32:09,427 --> 00:32:14,682
to make sure that Arnaldo
still comes out on top!

510
00:32:14,766 --> 00:32:16,184
At any cost!

511
00:32:16,768 --> 00:32:18,186
You're going help Arnaldo cheat?!

512
00:32:18,269 --> 00:32:19,979
After what he did to me?!

513
00:32:20,063 --> 00:32:22,023
-You can do that for him?!
-Yes!

514
00:32:22,982 --> 00:32:26,527
Because your best,
and everybody else's best…

515
00:32:27,612 --> 00:32:29,864
is still Arnaldo's worst!

516
00:32:31,199 --> 00:32:33,868
Arnaldo is the only hope we have…

517
00:32:34,285 --> 00:32:37,622
in making sure we maintain
our family's power.

518
00:32:39,123 --> 00:32:40,124
And after that,

519
00:32:41,125 --> 00:32:45,505
we deal with Ivy Aguas
and all our enemies.

520
00:32:47,131 --> 00:32:53,763
In the meantime,
look for that retard, Madrigal.

521
00:32:54,889 --> 00:32:59,852
And find wherever this Lily Cruz is.

522
00:33:00,603 --> 00:33:06,317
Send her back to whatever
hellhole she crawled out from!

523
00:33:10,822 --> 00:33:13,992
We are not going to lose this town.

524
00:33:19,706 --> 00:33:21,708
Bunch of scatterbrains!

525
00:33:33,011 --> 00:33:35,555
Ivy's just like that because
she wants to protect you.

526
00:33:36,222 --> 00:33:39,392
After everything you've been
through helping her,

527
00:33:39,475 --> 00:33:40,810
you still take her side?

528
00:33:40,893 --> 00:33:42,520
Anna, I'm not taking any sides here.

529
00:33:45,189 --> 00:33:46,816
I want to visit Aunt Carlotta.

530
00:33:48,234 --> 00:33:50,653
Anna, we've talked about this, right?

531
00:33:50,737 --> 00:33:52,739
I said I want to pay
Aunt Carlotta a visit.

532
00:33:52,822 --> 00:33:54,407
I know you want to visit her too.

533
00:34:02,915 --> 00:34:07,253
[instrumental theme music playing]

534
00:34:09,338 --> 00:34:11,257
<i>Ivy, I know everything.</i>

535
00:34:11,340 --> 00:34:13,384
<i>Those Ardientes ruined your life.</i>

536
00:34:13,468 --> 00:34:15,887
<i>But you're not the only one</i>
<i>who lost a loved one.</i>

537
00:34:15,970 --> 00:34:17,638
<i>Aunt Carlotta was like a mother to me too.</i>

538
00:34:17,722 --> 00:34:21,434
<i>Please don't deny me the chance</i>
<i>to seek justice for her death.</i>

539
00:34:30,985 --> 00:34:32,612
[young Jepoy] <i>I really like it here.</i>

540
00:34:33,696 --> 00:34:35,364
<i>It's not like Manila.</i>

541
00:34:35,448 --> 00:34:37,867
<i>But you'll still leave me here</i>

542
00:34:38,534 --> 00:34:41,287
<i>because you're going back</i>
<i>to Manila when school starts.</i>

543
00:34:42,538 --> 00:34:43,623
<i>Don't worry.</i>

544
00:34:43,706 --> 00:34:46,542
<i>I'll just ask Miss Prianka</i>

545
00:34:46,626 --> 00:34:48,586
<i>to come back here</i>
<i>for our vacation next year.</i>

546
00:34:49,420 --> 00:34:50,797
<i>-Let's go there.</i>
<i>-Let's go.</i>

547
00:35:00,014 --> 00:35:01,057
<i>Hello.</i>

548
00:35:05,520 --> 00:35:06,521
<i>Wait!</i>

549
00:35:07,980 --> 00:35:09,816
<i>Aunt Carlotta might be looking for me.</i>

550
00:35:09,899 --> 00:35:11,734
<i>Hey! She's our Nanny Carlotta.</i>

551
00:35:15,613 --> 00:35:17,323
<i>What do you mean?</i>

552
00:35:17,406 --> 00:35:21,202
<i>Well… She looks after us too.</i>

553
00:35:26,040 --> 00:35:28,126
<i>Are you Nanny Carlotta's niece?</i>

554
00:35:29,669 --> 00:35:32,004
<i>Miss Prianka told me about her.</i>

555
00:35:35,007 --> 00:35:38,177
<i>Aunt Carlotta asked me to stay with her.</i>

556
00:35:38,261 --> 00:35:40,388
<i>She said she'd take care of me.</i>

557
00:35:41,848 --> 00:35:43,766
<i>My mom already passed away.</i>

558
00:35:45,852 --> 00:35:47,270
<i>And so did my dad.</i>

559
00:35:48,604 --> 00:35:52,483
<i>Me too. Both my parents are gone.</i>

560
00:35:53,526 --> 00:35:55,403
<i>Well, I'm an orphan too.</i>

561
00:35:57,613 --> 00:36:01,033
<i>But we all have our Nanny Carlotta!</i>

562
00:36:03,619 --> 00:36:05,121
<i>Right. So, don't be sad.</i>

563
00:36:05,204 --> 00:36:07,915
<i>I'm the parking boy, Jepoy!</i>

564
00:36:09,208 --> 00:36:10,543
<i>Hey, you're not a parking boy</i>

565
00:36:10,626 --> 00:36:12,461
<i>because you're not</i>
<i>in the parking lot anymore.</i>

566
00:36:12,545 --> 00:36:16,048
<i>You're now called goat boy, Jepoy!</i>

567
00:36:16,132 --> 00:36:17,758
<i>Since we're on a farm!</i>

568
00:36:18,426 --> 00:36:21,053
<i>Didn't Nanny Carlotta ask</i>
<i>you to take care of the goats?</i>

569
00:36:23,556 --> 00:36:25,558
<i>By the way, I'm Lily.</i>

570
00:36:25,641 --> 00:36:26,851
<i>What's your name?</i>

571
00:36:27,476 --> 00:36:30,605
<i>I'm Anna. That's my name.</i>

572
00:36:34,734 --> 00:36:36,527
<i>Do you want to go to Nanny Carlotta now?</i>

573
00:36:36,611 --> 00:36:39,030
<i>Come with us! Come on, Anna!</i>

574
00:36:39,113 --> 00:36:40,740
<i>-Hurry!</i>
<i>-Let's find Nanny Carlotta!</i>

575
00:36:46,162 --> 00:36:50,708
[pensive music playing]

576
00:36:57,215 --> 00:36:58,257
[young Lily] <i>Let go of me!</i>

577
00:36:58,341 --> 00:36:59,550
<i>Let go of me!</i>

578
00:36:59,634 --> 00:37:00,551
[whistles]

579
00:37:00,635 --> 00:37:02,220
<i>If you're in trouble, blow this.</i>

580
00:37:02,303 --> 00:37:04,722
<i>I'm the parking boy! Jepoy!</i>

581
00:37:04,805 --> 00:37:06,641
<i>The cops! Run!</i>

582
00:37:07,934 --> 00:37:09,977
[police officer] <i>You two, chase</i>
<i>after them! Stand up!</i>

583
00:37:10,061 --> 00:37:11,479
[young Lily] <i>Here, eat up.</i>

584
00:37:11,562 --> 00:37:13,648
<i>You're like an angel.</i>

585
00:37:13,731 --> 00:37:16,234
[Arnaldo] <i>This is Madrigal.</i>
<i>My most trusted man.</i>

586
00:37:16,317 --> 00:37:17,777
<i>He'll accompany us.</i>

587
00:37:17,860 --> 00:37:18,903
[Ivy] <i>You find yourself in peril</i>

588
00:37:18,986 --> 00:37:21,364
<i>because you're one of Arnaldo's men,</i>

589
00:37:21,447 --> 00:37:23,908
<i>but you still continue to help me.</i>

590
00:37:26,410 --> 00:37:27,411
Ivy.

591
00:37:28,871 --> 00:37:29,830
Jepoy.

592
00:37:30,831 --> 00:37:31,916
Ivy.

593
00:37:47,848 --> 00:37:49,976
I'm happy to see you again, Jepoy.

594
00:37:51,602 --> 00:37:53,187
When you left Poblacion Ardiente,

595
00:37:53,271 --> 00:37:55,773
I didn't know what happened to you.

596
00:37:56,524 --> 00:37:57,733
I didn't know where to find you,

597
00:37:57,817 --> 00:38:02,738
so, now, I'm happy to see you
safe and sound.

598
00:38:05,408 --> 00:38:08,327
Didn't I promise you I wouldn't
leave no matter what happens?

599
00:38:10,538 --> 00:38:12,832
So, I need to stay alive to protect you.

600
00:38:23,301 --> 00:38:24,677
Thank you, Jepoy.

601
00:38:26,137 --> 00:38:27,638
Thank you for everything.

602
00:38:30,516 --> 00:38:34,020
While I was away, it was Anna
who nursed me back to health.

603
00:38:34,103 --> 00:38:37,064
Although it was hard for me,
I had to tell her everything.

604
00:38:37,481 --> 00:38:39,275
[soft piano music playing]

605
00:38:39,984 --> 00:38:40,985
I'm sorry.

606
00:38:41,736 --> 00:38:46,157
That's how we found out Emilia
was looking for the real Lily,

607
00:38:46,240 --> 00:38:47,116
so we began preparing.

608
00:38:48,200 --> 00:38:50,161
We waited, hidden in the shadows.

609
00:38:50,953 --> 00:38:52,955
We waited for the perfect opportunity

610
00:38:53,039 --> 00:38:55,207
to reveal Anna as the real Lily.

611
00:38:58,419 --> 00:39:00,504
Jepoy, we had an agreement.

612
00:39:01,130 --> 00:39:03,174
We wouldn't drag anyone else into this.

613
00:39:03,674 --> 00:39:07,595
Why did you tell Anna? Why her?

614
00:39:07,678 --> 00:39:12,767
Of all people… You know
how important Anna is to us.

615
00:39:13,768 --> 00:39:14,810
And you told her?

616
00:39:15,311 --> 00:39:16,729
What did you expect me to do?

617
00:39:17,897 --> 00:39:19,857
She insisted. What could I have done?

618
00:39:23,819 --> 00:39:26,530
Where is she? Where are you staying now?

619
00:39:28,407 --> 00:39:30,201
We're staying at a safe house.

620
00:39:31,744 --> 00:39:33,329
Actually, the real reason why I'm here is

621
00:39:33,412 --> 00:39:34,997
I want to ask you something.

622
00:39:36,415 --> 00:39:37,625
Sure. What is it?

623
00:39:38,918 --> 00:39:42,630
If it's okay, we'd like
to visit Nanny Carlotta.

624
00:39:42,713 --> 00:39:44,924
[somber piano music playing]

625
00:39:50,888 --> 00:39:53,224
All right. Everything's ready, let's eat.

626
00:39:53,307 --> 00:39:54,683
-Diego, sit over there.
-We're coming.

627
00:39:54,767 --> 00:39:55,935
Yes, Auntie.

628
00:39:56,018 --> 00:39:58,312
-Veggies.
-Yummy!

629
00:39:58,396 --> 00:40:00,815
-I'll sit here.
-Sit over here.

630
00:40:00,898 --> 00:40:03,567
Nanny, Uncle, Aunt Camia, Batch…

631
00:40:05,820 --> 00:40:07,613
I just want to say thank you.

632
00:40:08,614 --> 00:40:11,826
Because from the moment
I got arrested until I got out,

633
00:40:13,077 --> 00:40:14,537
you were always there for me.

634
00:40:14,620 --> 00:40:15,996
-Of course.
-You never left my side.

635
00:40:16,747 --> 00:40:19,917
Thank you for all your love and support.

636
00:40:22,211 --> 00:40:24,839
Well, we won't stop trying

637
00:40:24,922 --> 00:40:27,842
to show the people
that we're in the right.

638
00:40:29,009 --> 00:40:30,010
I know.

639
00:40:30,428 --> 00:40:31,971
And no matter what happens,

640
00:40:32,054 --> 00:40:37,685
we will continue to try our best
to take down the Ardientes.

641
00:40:38,185 --> 00:40:41,313
That's right. And we should
also continue eating!

642
00:40:41,397 --> 00:40:43,441
-Why are you so serious?
-We're just hungry.

643
00:40:43,524 --> 00:40:44,984
We might need to go to the hospital.

644
00:40:45,943 --> 00:40:49,488
[instrumental theme music playing]

645
00:40:57,413 --> 00:40:58,414
Nanny.

646
00:41:05,921 --> 00:41:07,548
Nanny, I miss you so much.

647
00:41:10,759 --> 00:41:12,136
Every day…

648
00:41:16,640 --> 00:41:18,058
I miss you, Nanny.

649
00:41:20,060 --> 00:41:21,979
Nanny, you have visitors.

650
00:41:23,522 --> 00:41:27,526
Jepoy is here. And Anna too.

651
00:41:28,611 --> 00:41:30,404
But, Nanny, please help me.

652
00:41:33,741 --> 00:41:35,242
Help me try to…

653
00:41:37,912 --> 00:41:43,626
convince them not to
push through with their plans.

654
00:41:46,420 --> 00:41:48,506
Nanny, I don't want them to get hurt.

655
00:41:51,425 --> 00:41:53,344
I hope they'll listen to me.

656
00:42:13,822 --> 00:42:15,824
[weeping]

657
00:42:25,209 --> 00:42:26,544
Auntie…

658
00:42:29,213 --> 00:42:32,216
Nanny, I couldn't protect you.

659
00:42:34,301 --> 00:42:36,387
[weeping]

660
00:42:36,971 --> 00:42:40,474
[instrumental theme music playing]

661
00:42:57,241 --> 00:42:58,826
[music fades]

662
00:43:00,035 --> 00:43:02,955
-[young Lily] <i>Come and get me!</i>
-[young Anna] <i>Hurry!</i>

663
00:43:03,038 --> 00:43:06,083
[Carlotta] <i>Hey! Lily, come here!</i>
<i>Dear, come here!</i>

664
00:43:06,166 --> 00:43:09,461
<i>-Who is it?!</i>
<i>-Lily, dear!</i>

665
00:43:09,545 --> 00:43:11,130
[young Jepoy] <i>You're it!</i>

666
00:43:13,632 --> 00:43:16,135
[young Lily] <i>She caught me.</i>

667
00:43:16,218 --> 00:43:17,428
[Carlotta] <i>Are you all hungry?</i>

668
00:43:17,511 --> 00:43:19,054
-[young Lily] <i>Starving!</i>
-[Carlotta] <i>Okay.</i>

669
00:43:19,138 --> 00:43:20,139
[young Lily] <i>What's that?</i>

670
00:43:26,645 --> 00:43:27,855
[inaudible]

671
00:43:45,623 --> 00:43:48,542
-[Carlotta] <i>Just keep eating.</i>
-[young Lily] <i>Let's eat first.</i>

672
00:43:48,626 --> 00:43:49,835
<i>Go ahead. Come on.</i>

673
00:43:49,918 --> 00:43:51,420
<i>Here's your spoon. Let's eat, Nanny!</i>

674
00:43:51,503 --> 00:43:54,048
[Carlotta] <i>I'll eat later. You go ahead.</i>

675
00:43:54,131 --> 00:43:56,425
<i>-Have some bananas.</i>
<i>-Nanny, here's the knife!</i>

676
00:43:56,508 --> 00:43:58,844
[Carlotta] <i>Oh, dear! Let's eat.</i>

677
00:43:59,386 --> 00:44:02,139
[Carlotta giggling]

678
00:44:02,222 --> 00:44:04,141
-[young Lily] <i>You're it!</i>
-[young Anna] <i>What?!</i>

679
00:44:04,224 --> 00:44:07,728
[young Lily] <i>Nanny, you're it!</i>

680
00:44:08,270 --> 00:44:10,230
-[Carlotta] <i>Oh.</i>
-[young Lily] <i>You're it, Nanny.</i>

681
00:44:11,482 --> 00:44:12,608
[young Lily] <i>You're it!</i>

682
00:44:12,691 --> 00:44:14,526
[Carlotta laughing]

683
00:44:17,237 --> 00:44:19,114
[Carlotta] <i>I'm it? But I wasn't playing!</i>

684
00:44:20,324 --> 00:44:21,867
[Carlotta laughing]

685
00:44:30,042 --> 00:44:32,044
[Anna weeping]

686
00:44:34,546 --> 00:44:35,547
[sobs]

687
00:44:37,508 --> 00:44:38,717
[sobbing]

688
00:44:51,146 --> 00:44:52,731
[Arnaldo] <i>You're worried I'll lose too.</i>

689
00:44:52,815 --> 00:44:55,901
[Julio] <i>Yes. Don't give me</i>
<i>that surprised look.</i>

690
00:44:55,984 --> 00:44:57,444
<i>Because you know I'm right!</i>

691
00:44:57,528 --> 00:45:00,447
<i>You allowed your emotions</i>

692
00:45:00,531 --> 00:45:03,951
<i>to rule over that thick head of yours.</i>

693
00:45:04,034 --> 00:45:05,786
[Anna] <i>Why will you marry that monster?</i>

694
00:45:05,869 --> 00:45:08,539
[Ivy] <i>You need to trust my plans.</i>

695
00:45:08,622 --> 00:45:11,959
<i>Don't try to stop my wedding</i>
<i>or any of my plans.</i>

696
00:45:12,042 --> 00:45:12,960
<i>Don't you dare.</i>

697
00:45:13,043 --> 00:45:15,129
<i>-I'm not weak.</i>
<i>-You're helpless!</i>

698
00:45:15,212 --> 00:45:16,839
<i>Take back what you said!</i>

699
00:45:16,922 --> 00:45:19,258
<i>You don't want Ivy</i>
<i>to marry Arnaldo, either.</i>

700
00:45:19,341 --> 00:45:20,717
<i>You already know my answer to that.</i>

701
00:45:20,801 --> 00:45:24,012
<i>It's time to stop pretending.</i>
<i>You should have revealed yourself.</i>

702
00:45:24,096 --> 00:45:26,098
[theme music playing]
